{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他还没想透，还是先接下自己能做的一份，不再干等。\",\n      \"key\": \"不再干等\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"结果还没把握，疑虑和牵挂也还在，可他做着做着有了些力气，也有点骄傲，越投入越痛快。\",\n      \"key\": \"越投入越痛快\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是舍不得那些说不清的珍贵东西，它们仿佛还在，却已不能像从前那样拥有。\",\n      \"key\": \"珍贵东西\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他一察觉失落，就急着把心思拉回眼前，反复劝自己撑得住，越劝越显出他其实很在意。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复劝自己\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心垮下去，可一想到仍放不下的事，刚撑起的劲又泄了，只好重新提起劲，心里始终安顿不下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"不甘心垮下去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B5\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把原则式的等待理由改成他还没想透却先接下能做的一份，保留对S01-4的第一次回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\", \"R8\", \"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留结果无把握、疑虑和牵挂仍在，以及行动带来的力量、骄傲和投入时的痛快；把重复的主体性宣言并入实际感受，不把痛快写成牵挂已经消失。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的一小块心改成他仍舍不得、却不能像从前那样拥有的珍贵东西，补足B1的私人牵挂和B2的脆弱底色。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R7\", \"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把已经能支配疑虑、不再审视软弱，改成失落时反复劝自己撑得住、越劝越显出在意，贴合B4的自我控制和反复说服。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足\",\n      \"why\": \"把行动的劲头与仍放不下的事相撞时的反复起落写清，保留不甘心垮下去的力量，同时解释B3的聚力、泄力和焦急，以及B5的不甘心。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fef36c67-9635-4e3d-a5d3-59da2d27e4f5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T232409416225Z", "elapsed_seconds": 204.265, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:27:33.696336+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e2c2c3e074e8cb534dafcd1078ca0deca5302d2e7110247cfdd58dd32db7bc89", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "direct